1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:07,000
Every year, millions of orators compete in forensics, declamation, and public keynotes.

2
00:00:07,299 --> 00:00:14,199
Yet speech evaluation remains trapped in an adjudication crisis: plagued by severe judge subjectivity...

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:20,500
...inconsistent scoring across ballots, and vague, non-actionable feedback.

4
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:27,500
Today, we introduce VOCODE: a physics-grounded multimodal engine that transforms oratorical evaluation.

5
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:35,000
Traditional speech tools suffer from three fatal flaws. First: unilateral penalization bias.

6
00:00:35,299 --> 00:00:42,500
A dramatic rhetorical pause is naively flagged as dead air, and quiet emotional inflection as mumbling.

7
00:00:42,799 --> 00:00:49,500
Second, human feedback lacks timestamps and acoustic measurements.

8
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:57,000
Third, existing ML corpora evaluate only what words were spoken, completely ignoring how they were delivered.

9
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:05,200
To ground evaluation objectively, we constructed a custom paired contrastive speech dataset.

10
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:12,799
We sourced and transcribed 48 masterclass public speeches—from MLK and JFK to Churchill and Steve Jobs.

11
00:01:13,099 --> 00:01:20,500
Holding speech text constant as a scientific control, our 6-dimensional flaw injection engine synthesizes a 4-tier spectrum...

12
00:01:20,799 --> 00:01:27,500
...from pristine delivery to severe panic, temporally grounding every flaw with millisecond precision.

13
00:01:28,599 --> 00:01:35,799
The VOCODE pipeline begins with a 4-layer monologue gatekeeper, rejecting multi-speaker dialogue and background noise.

14
00:01:36,099 --> 00:01:43,500
Raw audio passes through a 7-stage broadcast standardization pipeline: 16 kHz sinc resampling...

15
00:01:43,799 --> 00:01:51,000
...a 70 Hz high-pass filter eliminating microphone handling rumble, and EBU R128 loudness normalization.

16
00:01:51,299 --> 00:01:59,000
Next, our engine extracts dense 100 Hz physical telemetry: micro-prosodic pitch semitones, PAPR crest factor in dB...

17
00:01:59,299 --> 00:02:07,500
...and adherence to the 20% Oratorical Pause Law, feeding directly into our non-unilateral rubric.

18
00:02:08,599 --> 00:02:16,000
Let's see VOCODE in action on our live dashboard. The landing portal features dual rotating tape reels with zero-storage streaming.

19
00:02:16,500 --> 00:02:25,000
First, we evaluate Dr. Martin Luther King Jr.'s masterclass delivery of 'I Have a Dream'. Overall score: 9.20 out of 10.

20
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:33,500
The multi-track waveform highlights brilliant pitch excursions and resonant cadence across all five oratorical pillars.

21
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:42,000
Now, we load the contrastive Tier 3 botched mirror of the exact same speech text. Instantly, the score drops to 4.70 out of 10.

22
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:51,000
Look at the waveform: VOCODE isolates a 4.8-second dead-air freeze in crimson red, capping the score under the Paralyzing Silence ceiling.

23
00:02:51,500 --> 00:03:00,000
Clicking on any blunder card seeks the custom HTML5 audio player directly to the millisecond of failure.

24
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:18,500
In the Coach tab, VOCODE delivers actionable pedagogical training: prescribing the 1-second eye-contact reset and 4 daily practice routines.

25
00:03:23,599 --> 00:03:31,500
Under the hood, VOCODE prevents unilateral false penalties through systemic impairment coupling.

26
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:40,500
If an orator speaks softly but maintains agile pitch modulation and natural pausing, our engine recognizes an intimate rhetorical choice.

27
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:50,000
Dynamic leniency calibration allows judges to toggle between strict competition forensics and novice coaching.

28
00:03:50,500 --> 00:04:01,500
Furthermore, continuous speech is partitioned into discrete Rhetorical Move Cards: Brilliant moves, Mistakes, and Blunders.

29
00:04:02,599 --> 00:04:09,500
VOCODE rigorously addresses all five official Hackathon evaluation criteria.

30
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:17,500
Our 200-clip empirical benchmark demonstrates strong statistical correlation with expert human judges.

31
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:27,000
We deliver 25% causal explainability through dual DSP and LLM reasoning, 30% robust data engineering across 48 masterclass speeches...

32
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:36,500
...20% feature extraction via 100 Hz physics, 15% interactive dashboard usability, and 10% containerized reproducibility.

33
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:44,500
VOCODE is fully open source, containerized with Docker, and immediately reproducible across local environments.

34
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:51,500
By bridging digital signal processing, contrastive dataset engineering, and generative AI coaching...

35
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:56,000
...VOCODE transforms public speaking into an empowering, objective science. Thank you.

